class_name Mill
extends RefCounted
## Korbinian the miller (map letter ü) and why the village needs him. He works by day behind his
## counter in the mill one walks into (see MillTower and VillageHalls, "mill"), with the millstones
## turning under the sails beside him, and:
## - sells grain (Körner) for the hungry chicks in the nests on the village roofs (see
##   VillageBirds): the only place to buy it (Mira's shop no longer has it);
## - gives the hero a sack of flour to carry to Fritz at the tavern for the soup and the bread
##   (the quest "mehl", see Quests), for copper and the village's goodwill.

## The miller's window (see Menus._build_miller) and his station.
const KIND := "muehle"
## The most grain one buy can take at once.
const MOST := 20
## The sack of flour for the tavern (see Items and the quest "mehl").
const FLOUR := "mehlsack"
